      "independent_solution": [
        "Leg k (500 m) points at 60(k-1) deg. After 3 legs: x = 500(cos0 + cos60 + cos120) = 500 m, y = 500(sin0 + sin60 + sin120) = 866 m, so |d| = 1000 m at atan(866/500) = 60 deg to the start direction; path 1.5 km.",
        "After 6 legs the headings 0..300 deg close a regular hexagon: displacement is the null vector; path 3 km.",
        "After 8 legs = hexagon + 2 legs: x = 500(1 + 0.5) = 750 m, y = 433 m, so |d| = 866 m at 30 deg; path 4 km. Path length exceeds |displacement| in every case."
      ],
      "independent_answer": "1 km at 60 deg (path 1.5 km); null vector (path 3 km); 866 m at 30 deg (path 4 km)",
      "official_answer": "Displacement of magnitude 1 km and direction 60 deg with the initial direction; path 1.5 km (third turn); null displacement, path 3 km (sixth turn); 866 m, 30 deg, 4 km (eighth turn)",
      "agrees": true,
      "numeric_check": "sqrt((500*(1+cos(radians(60))+cos(radians(120))))**2 + (500*(sin(radians(60))+sin(radians(120))))**2)/1000"
    },
    {
      "card_ref": "EV-PHY-11-MIP-05-012",
      "independent_solution": [
        "A.B = (1)(1) + (1)(-1) = 0 while |A| = |B| = sqrt2.",
        "cos(theta) = 0/(sqrt2 sqrt2) = 0, so theta = 90 deg: option (b)."
      ],
      "independent_answer": "(b) 90 deg",
      "official_answer": "(b), 90 deg",
      "agrees": true,
      "numeric_check": "degrees(acos(0/(sqrt(2)*sqrt(2))))"
    },
    {
      "card_ref": "EV-PHY-11-MIP-05-014",
      "independent_solution": [
        "|A+B|^2 = A^2 + B^2 + 2AB cos(theta) and |A-B|^2 = A^2 + B^2 - 2AB cos(theta); they are equal iff 4AB cos(theta) = 0.",
        "That holds when theta = 90 deg (A perpendicular to B) or when A or B is zero; equal non-zero magnitudes alone (a), or equal parallel/antiparallel vectors (c), give |A+B| != |A-B|. So (b) and (d)."
      ],
      "independent_answer": "(b) and (d)",
      "official_answer": "(b), (d)",
